('hell','output','Berapa nilai sel yang ditunjuk pointer di akhir program?','What is the value of the cell under the pointer at the end?','++++++[>+++++++<-]>','brainfuck','["52","42","84"]'::jsonb,null,1,'Loop menambah 7 sebanyak 6 kali = 42.','The loop adds 7, 6 times = 42.','Loop berjalan 6 kali (sel pertama dikurangi 1 tiap putaran) dan setiap putaran menambah 7 ke sel kedua. Pointer berakhir di sel kedua.','The loop runs 6 times (the first cell drops by 1 each pass) and every pass adds 7 to the second cell. The pointer ends on the second cell.'),
