('hell','output','Apa output program Brainfuck ini?','What does this Brainfuck program output?','++++++++++++[>+++++<-]>+++++++++.+.','brainfuck','["DE","EF","FG"]'::jsonb,null,1,'Loop menghitung 12x5, ditambah 9, lalu dicetak sebagai ASCII.','The loop computes 12x5, plus 9, then prints it as ASCII.','Loop menambah 5 ke sel kedua sebanyak 12 kali, lalu ditambah 9 lagi. Hasil akhirnya dicetak sebagai karakter ASCII (A = 65). Setelah itu sel dinaikkan 1 dan dicetak lagi.','The loop adds 5 to the second cell 12 times, then 9 more. The final value is printed as an ASCII character (A = 65). Afterwards the cell is raised by 1 and printed again.'),
('hell','output','Berapa nilai sel yang ditunjuk pointer di akhir program?','What is the value of the cell under the pointer at the end?','+++++++++++++[>++++++++<-]>','brainfuck','["103","114","104"]'::jsonb,null,2,'Loop menambah 8 sebanyak 13 kali = 104.','The loop adds 8, 13 times = 104.','Loop berjalan 13 kali (sel pertama dikurangi 1 tiap putaran) dan setiap putaran menambah 8 ke sel kedua. Pointer berakhir di sel kedua.','The loop runs 13 times (the first cell drops by 1 each pass) and every pass adds 8 to the second cell. The pointer ends on the second cell.'),
('hell','output','Apa output program Brainfuck ini?','What does this Brainfuck program output?','+++++++[>++++++++++<-]>++++++++++++.+.','brainfuck','["ST","QR","RS"]'::jsonb,null,2,'Loop menghitung 7x10, ditambah 12, lalu dicetak sebagai ASCII.','The loop computes 7x10, plus 12, then prints it as ASCII.','Loop menambah 10 ke sel kedua sebanyak 7 kali, lalu ditambah 12 lagi. Hasil akhirnya dicetak sebagai karakter ASCII (A = 65). Setelah itu sel dinaikkan 1 dan dicetak lagi.','The loop adds 10 to the second cell 7 times, then 12 more. The final value is printed as an ASCII character (A = 65). Afterwards the cell is raised by 1 and printed again.'),
