('hell','output','Apa arti byte mesin x86 ini?','What do these x86 machine bytes mean?','4B','text','["dec ebx","dec esi","inc ebx"]'::jsonb,null,0,'Opcode x86: 50-57 push, 58-5F pop, 40-47 inc, 48-4F dec, B8 mov eax.','x86 opcodes: 50-57 push, 58-5F pop, 40-47 inc, 48-4F dec, B8 mov eax.','Rentang opcode: 50-57 push, 58-5F pop, 40-47 inc, 48-4F dec; urutan register: eax, ecx, edx, ebx, esp, ebp, esi, edi. Kurangi byte pertama dengan awal rentang untuk mendapat nomor register. Byte B8 + angka 32-bit berarti mov eax, nilai.','Opcode ranges: 50-57 push, 58-5F pop, 40-47 inc, 48-4F dec; register order: eax, ecx, edx, ebx, esp, ebp, esi, edi. Subtract the range start from the first byte to get the register number. Byte B8 + a 32-bit number means mov eax, value.'),
