('hell','output','Apa output program Brainfuck ini?','What does this Brainfuck program output?','+++++++++++[>++++++++<-]>.++.','brainfuck','["WY","Y[","XZ"]'::jsonb,null,2,'Loop menghitung 11x8, ditambah 0, lalu dicetak sebagai ASCII.','The loop computes 11x8, plus 0, then prints it as ASCII.','Loop menambah 8 ke sel kedua sebanyak 11 kali, lalu ditambah 0 lagi. Hasil akhirnya dicetak sebagai karakter ASCII (A = 65). Setelah itu sel dinaikkan 2 dan dicetak lagi.','The loop adds 8 to the second cell 11 times, then 0 more. The final value is printed as an ASCII character (A = 65). Afterwards the cell is raised by 2 and printed again.'),
