('hell','output','Apa output program Brainfuck ini?','What does this Brainfuck program output?','++++++++++[>+++++++<-]>+.+.','brainfuck','["HI","GH","FG"]'::jsonb,null,1,'Loop menghitung 10x7, ditambah 1, lalu dicetak sebagai ASCII.','The loop computes 10x7, plus 1, then prints it as ASCII.','Loop menambah 7 ke sel kedua sebanyak 10 kali, lalu ditambah 1 lagi. Hasil akhirnya dicetak sebagai karakter ASCII (A = 65). Setelah itu sel dinaikkan 1 dan dicetak lagi.','The loop adds 7 to the second cell 10 times, then 1 more. The final value is printed as an ASCII character (A = 65). Afterwards the cell is raised by 1 and printed again.'),
