('hell','output','Berapa nilai sel yang ditunjuk pointer di akhir program?','What is the value of the cell under the pointer at the end?','+++++++[>+++++++++++++++<-]>','brainfuck','["103","95","105"]'::jsonb,null,2,'Loop menambah 15 sebanyak 7 kali = 105.','The loop adds 15, 7 times = 105.','Loop berjalan 7 kali (sel pertama dikurangi 1 tiap putaran) dan setiap putaran menambah 15 ke sel kedua. Pointer berakhir di sel kedua.','The loop runs 7 times (the first cell drops by 1 each pass) and every pass adds 15 to the second cell. The pointer ends on the second cell.'),
('hell','output','Berapa nilai sel yang ditunjuk pointer di akhir program?','What is the value of the cell under the pointer at the end?','++++++++++++[>++++++++++++++<-]>','brainfuck','["167","169","168"]'::jsonb,null,2,'Loop menambah 14 sebanyak 12 kali = 168.','The loop adds 14, 12 times = 168.','Loop berjalan 12 kali (sel pertama dikurangi 1 tiap putaran) dan setiap putaran menambah 14 ke sel kedua. Pointer berakhir di sel kedua.','The loop runs 12 times (the first cell drops by 1 each pass) and every pass adds 14 to the second cell. The pointer ends on the second cell.'),
